#: scenario5:scenario5_3278D5C0_A12F_4186_96D9_B185A12BE12D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb69265018a804e75e484e400df52d816ebcaee236c9a07d2b88a0c2162d9ca1
