msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Riding the moonlight’s current, his hand fell against my cheek.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was much colder "
"than I had expected,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Влекомая потоком лунного света, его рука коснулась моей щеки.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Она была намного "
"холоднее, чем я ожидала,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E05F5ED4_80BB_4F67_9BDF_F9C180B1D998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af346227acc83be5bb0ee7dde1b24f64f0e416bb670c3d52db4c922f5507d286
