#: scenario5:scenario5_4C258C3C_FBBC_4297_8065_D0282F64B8D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03ab41d578abfd88e18077a35dc70f7d3715c671767d1b55483d825a89007b58
