msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D8F4895_1F87_4C6A_B3C9_1A2B8DB269D9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there... ⟪k:1⟫I saw her scars."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫И там... ⟪k:1⟫я увидел шрамы."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E00D948_8376_419F_ADEC_A22AABE51F83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bc6a603426eda8b424c22de924bbd260b9ea345bcf95a5b9944e6f111e3782a
#. default-sha256: ae9734380ee8e532cb306c64f38316596323d250e9f693643bdc81b6f35958f2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E00D948_8376_419F_ADEC_A22AABE51F83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Swollen, red-and-black gashes, still not healed after more than a year, defiled her white "
"flesh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Набухшие, красновато-бурые раны, не зажившие даже по прошествии года, оскверняли ее белую "
"плоть."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4D726119_BE4D_4340_92F6_5A7B0017C444
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2a7774ee6ff25858527bc808dfc4b157169e256ebfa19184e19b9e1dc0b1ade
#. default-sha256: d5564c360719cbfa40815b58215ecd40efaaff8b9692a53626421ee59ee98fb6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4D726119_BE4D_4340_92F6_5A7B0017C444"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As she had described for me, the lines were arranged to form letters carved into her skin."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Как она и описывала мне, линии на ее коже образовывали форму букв."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6E647427_039A_41AC_9B8D_983F38424F1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 951fef9dd0c5372cdba01acf11927c02238d27379a36952b0b11ec3ef49a0182
